.TH std::layout_stride::mapping::required_span_size 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::layout_stride::mapping::required_span_size \- std::layout_stride::mapping::required_span_size

.SH Synopsis
constexpr index_type required_span_size() const noexcept;  (since C++23)

Returns the required size of the mapping.

Let s be equal to:

  * 1, if extents().rank() == 0 is true,
  * otherwise, 0, if the size of the multidimensional index space extents() is 0,
  * otherwise, 1 plus the sum of products of extents().extent(r) - 1 and
    extents_type::index-cast(strides_[r]) for all r in the range [0, extents().rank()).

A call is equivalent to return s;.

.SH Return value

The required size of the mapping.

